sdata> -- ADR-066/issue #88: an unterminated string literal typed interactively
sdata> -- must cleanly reset the REPL session (matching Run_REPL's existing
sdata> -- Script_Error handler), not crash it and not silently drop the error.
sdata> -- The session must still work normally afterward.
sdata> SET X = 7
sdata> RUN
RUN complete. 1 records and 0 variables processed.
sdata> LET Y$ = "bad
Error: unterminated string literal at line 1
sdata> NOTE X
7.00000
sdata> QUIT
